# Studio (`apps/studio/schemas/` + migration)

- **Document types:** `post`, `teamMember`, `customer`, `integration`, `helpcenter`, `changelog`, `infopage`, singleton `siteSettings` — registered in `schemas/index.ts`.
- **Any schema change** requires matching updates in `apps/web/src/lib/sanity/queries.ts`, `transforms.ts`, `types.ts`, and often `apps/web/src/content.config.ts` / sample markdown if parity is required.
- **`scripts/migrate-to-sanity.ts`:** Maps markdown + `apps/web/src/images/` into Sanity documents; uses `SANITY_PROJECT_ID` from `apps/web/.env` and `SANITY_WRITE_TOKEN` or `SANITY_TOKEN`. `--full` / `pnpm seed:all` deletes listed content types then re-imports — reread the script before relying on deletion behavior.
- **`structure.ts`:** Desk structure; add new types there when you add schemas.
